{"title":"Career Roadmap · Energy Modelling Specialist","role":"Energy Modelling Specialist","summary":"An Energy Modelling Specialist evaluates how buildings consume, generate, and conserve energy using simulation and performance-analysis tools. The role sits at the intersection of architecture, building physics, HVAC, lighting, climate, sustainability, and data analysis.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Sustainable / Green Architecture"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Energy Modelling Specialist evaluates how buildings consume, generate, and conserve energy using simulation and performance-analysis tools. The role sits at the intersection of architecture, building physics, HVAC, lighting, climate, sustainability, and data analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate specializing in sustainable architecture, this is a strong career path because architectural decisions—orientation, envelope, glazing, shading, materials, ventilation and massing—directly influence building energy performance."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building energy simulation models"},{"text":"Analysing heating, cooling and lighting loads"},{"text":"Studying building envelope performance"},{"text":"Performing daylight and thermal analysis"},{"text":"Evaluating HVAC energy consumption"},{"text":"Comparing passive-design alternatives"},{"text":"Conducting energy-efficiency studies"},{"text":"Supporting green-building certifications"},{"text":"Preparing energy-performance reports"},{"text":"Developing building-performance dashboards"},{"text":"Supporting net-zero and low-carbon building strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Sustainable / Green Architecture Knowledge","Building Physics + Energy Modelling","Energy Modelling Intern / Junior Analyst","Energy Modelling Specialist","Senior Energy Analyst / Building Performance Consultant","Building Performance Lead","Sustainability / Net-Zero Consultant","Building Performance / Sustainability Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Architecture fundamentals + environmental studies"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Building physics + climate-responsive design"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Energy simulation + BIM + performance analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced modelling + sustainability projects + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years after UG"},{"text":"Junior Energy Analyst / Energy Modelling Engineer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Energy Modelling Specialist / Building Performance Consultant"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Building Performance / Sustainability Consultant"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Building Performance Lead / Net-Zero Consultant / Sustainability Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-Wise Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Architecture + Environmental Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic focus"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Building construction"},{"text":"Engineering graphics"},{"text":"Basic structures"},{"text":"Environmental studies"},{"text":"Climate-responsive architecture"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Basic mathematics and physics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start understanding"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar radiation"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Humidity"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Building orientation"},{"text":"Natural ventilation"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Daylight"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Revit basics"},{"text":"Rhino basics"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mini projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build simple studies such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar orientation analysis"},{"text":"Natural ventilation study"},{"text":"Daylight analysis of a studio"},{"text":"Shading-device comparison"},{"text":"Climate-responsive house design"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Building Physics & Sustainable Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should move beyond conventional architecture."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn building physics"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Topics"],"rows":[[{"text":"Thermal"},{"text":"Heat transfer, U-value, thermal resistance"}],[{"text":"Solar"},{"text":"Solar gains, radiation, shading"}],[{"text":"Envelope"},{"text":"Walls, roofs, glazing"}],[{"text":"Ventilation"},{"text":"Natural and mechanical ventilation"}],[{"text":"Comfort"},{"text":"PMV, PPD, adaptive comfort"}],[{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Daylight, illuminance, glare"}],[{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Heating, cooling, lighting loads"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Important concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Climate","Site + Orientation","Building Form","Envelope","Solar / Thermal Behaviour","HVAC + Lighting","Energy Consumption","Comfort + Carbon"]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools to begin"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate Consultant"},{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"Rhino + Grasshopper"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Revit"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Energy Modelling Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 3 should be the major transition from sustainable architect → building-performance professional."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn energy simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Important software/ecosystems include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"OpenStudio"},{"text":"IES VE"},{"text":"DesignBuilder"},{"text":"eQUEST"},{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"Honeybee"},{"text":"Rhino + Grasshopper"},{"text":"You do not need to master all of them."}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong combination is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino / Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel / Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn EnergyPlus concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building geometry"},{"text":"Thermal zones"},{"text":"Construction assemblies"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Windows"},{"text":"Schedules"},{"text":"Internal loads"},{"text":"HVAC systems"},{"text":"Weather files"},{"text":"Solar gains"},{"text":"Infiltration"},{"text":"Natural ventilation"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Peak loads"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Advanced Modelling + Professional Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus on producing portfolio-quality building performance studies."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced topics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Whole-building energy simulation"},{"text":"HVAC modelling"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"Daylight simulation"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Solar analysis"},{"text":"Energy benchmarking"},{"text":"Carbon analysis"},{"text":"Net-zero buildings"},{"text":"Building energy codes"},{"text":"Green-building certification"},{"text":"Existing-building energy audits"},{"text":"Retrofit modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn data analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Python becomes valuable here."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful libraries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Plotly"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Energy Simulation","Simulation Results","CSV / Database","Python + pandas","Analysis","Graphs + KPIs","Design Recommendation"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Architectural Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Building Physics"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Climate Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Thermal Comfort"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Building Envelope"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Energy Modelling"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"HVAC Fundamentals"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Daylight Analysis"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Solar Analysis"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Rhino/Grasshopper"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"OpenStudio"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Ladybug/Honeybee"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Green Building Standards"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"Technical Reporting"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Core Software Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Architecture & BIM"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"SketchUp"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental analysis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate Consultant"},{"text":"Ladybug"},{"text":"Honeybee"},{"text":"Grasshopper"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Energy simulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"OpenStudio"},{"text":"IES VE"},{"text":"DesignBuilder"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analysis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Enscape / similar visualization tools"}]}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should demonstrate measurable energy-performance improvements, not just attractive architectural renders."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Residential Energy Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an energy model of a residential building."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orientation"},{"text":"Wall materials"},{"text":"Roof"},{"text":"Window-to-wall ratio"},{"text":"Glazing"},{"text":"Shading"},{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Lighting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Base Design","Energy Simulation","Identify Energy Loss","Passive Design Improvements","Re-simulation","Energy Reduction %"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Office Building Energy Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Model a commercial office and evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual electricity consumption"},{"text":"Cooling demand"},{"text":"Lighting demand"},{"text":"HVAC performance"},{"text":"Peak cooling load"},{"text":"Occupancy schedules"},{"text":"Produce a professional performance report."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Parametric Building Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Grasshopper + Ladybug/Honeybee"},{"type":"p","text":"Test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building orientation"},{"text":"Window size"},{"text":"Shading depth"},{"text":"Wall insulation"},{"text":"Roof insulation"},{"text":"Glazing type"},{"text":"Then identify the best-performing combination."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Daylight + Energy Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["More Glazing","More Daylight","Lower Artificial Lighting","BUT","Higher Solar Heat Gain","Higher Cooling Demand"]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to find an optimum rather than simply maximize glazing."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Net-Zero Building Concept"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a building strategy combining:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passive design"},{"text":"High-performance envelope"},{"text":"Efficient HVAC"},{"text":"Efficient lighting"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Energy monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy demand"},{"text":"Renewable generation"},{"text":"Annual energy balance"},{"text":"Operational carbon"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architecture firms"},{"text":"Sustainable design firms"},{"text":"Green-building consultancies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Climate analysis"},{"text":"Passive design"},{"text":"Site analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building-performance consultancies"},{"text":"Sustainability consultancies"},{"text":"MEP consulting firms"},{"text":"Energy audit companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy modelling"},{"text":"Daylight analysis"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"HVAC analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target highly relevant internships such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy Modelling Intern"},{"text":"Building Performance Intern"},{"text":"Sustainability Consultant Intern"},{"text":"Building Simulation Intern"},{"text":"Green Building Consultant Intern"},{"text":"Energy Analyst Intern"},{"text":"The final internship should ideally involve real building simulation rather than only architectural drafting."}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Job Titles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The exact title \"Energy Modelling Specialist\" may not be used by every employer."},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy Modelling Analyst"},{"text":"Energy Analyst"},{"text":"Building Performance Analyst"},{"text":"Building Energy Analyst"},{"text":"Building Simula