,"text":"many sustainability certificates + no modelling portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A B.Arch is a suitable foundation, but advanced modelling roles can benefit significantly from postgraduate specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant PG paths"},{"type":"table","header":["PG Area","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Arch Sustainable Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Arch Environmental Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Arch Building Technology"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Arch Energy Efficient Architecture"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Building Science"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Building Performance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Energy Engineering"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"HVAC / Building Services"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Urban Sustainability"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended path"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Sustainable Architecture","Energy Modelling + Building Physics","Internship","Junior Building Performance Analyst","M.Arch / MSc Building Performance"]},{"type":"p","text":"OR"},{"type":"flow","items":["Continue Industry Experience","Energy Modelling Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not always mandatory for entry-level energy modelling, but it can substantially strengthen progression into advanced building-performance, research and specialist consulting roles."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Paths","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Building Energy Modelling"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","EnergyPlus","OpenStudio","HVAC + Building Physics","Energy Analyst","Senior Energy Modeller"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best for students interested in simulation and quantitative analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Parametric Building Performance"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Rhino","Grasshopper","Ladybug + Honeybee","Parametric Optimization","Building Performance Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best for students who enjoy computational design."},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — Green Building Consultancy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Sustainable Architecture","LEED / IGBC / GRIHA","Building Performance","Green Building Consultant","Sustainability Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path D — Net-Zero Buildings"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Passive Design","Energy Modelling","Renewable Energy","Carbon Analysis","Net-Zero Building Specialist"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path E — Research / Building Science"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","M.Arch / MSc Building Science","Advanced Simulation","Research Projects","Building Performance Researcher","PhD / Research Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The field is increasingly moving toward automated, data-driven building performance."},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-assisted building optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help optimize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building orientation"},{"text":"Envelope design"},{"text":"HVAC operation"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Digital Twins"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM Model"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IoT Sensors"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Building Data","Digital Twin","Real-Time Performance Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Smart Building Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Integration of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"BMS"},{"text":"Energy meters"},{"text":"Occupancy sensors"},{"text":"AI analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Generative Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Use computational methods to generate and evaluate hundreds of design alternatives."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Operational Carbon Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Future building-performance professionals increasingly need to understand both:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operational energy/carbon"},{"text":"Embodied carbon"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Automated Energy Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"AI and parametric workflows can increasingly automate parts of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BIM","Geometry Extraction","Energy Model","Simulation","Optimization","Performance Report"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Minimum employability stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Physics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"One Energy Modelling Platform"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Ladybug/Honeybee"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HVAC Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3–4 Energy Modelling Projects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong candidate stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainable / Green Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Physics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino + Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Ladybug + Honeybee"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EnergyPlus / OpenStudio"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"IES VE / DesignBuilder"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HVAC Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python + pandas"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Energy & Carbon Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Green Building Knowledge"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Real Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the end of B.Arch, the student should ideally be able to take a building from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architectural Design","BIM Model","Climate Analysis","Building Physics","Energy Model","Simulation","Performance Analysis","Design Optimization","Energy / Carbon Report"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Have at least 4–5 serious projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Residential energy simulation"},{"text":"Commercial building energy model"},{"text":"Parametric energy optimization"},{"text":"Daylight + thermal comfort analysis"},{"text":"Net-zero / low-energy building study"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Each project should show inputs","simulation","results","design intervention","measurable improvement"]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not simply \"B.Arch + Sustainability.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Position yourself as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architect","Building Performance","Energy Modelling Specialist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"The key differentiator is the ability to connect architectural design decisions with measurable building performance."},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Physics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Energy Simulation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Computational Design"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analysis","Building Performance Professional"]},{"type":"p","text":"This combination creates a strong pathway toward Energy Modelling Specialist → Senior Building Performance Consultant → Net-Zero / Sustainability Lead, while keeping options open in sustainable architecture, building science, energy efficiency and computational building performance."}]}]}